=== W. uninstall (last: it deletes the pretend Debian folder)
-- an unknown option
spft: uninstall: unknown option '--frob'  (the only option is --yes)
exit=1
-- anything but "yes" cancels
This deletes the Debian system in $T/invisible (SP Flash Tool, box64 and everything else inside it)
and the downloads in $T/dl. It stops SP Flash Tool if it is running.
Your own files in the phone's storage are NOT touched. The spft command and its folder stay.
